# Accepted image-scan findings. Every entry needs a reason and an expiry date;
# Trivy reports the finding again once the date passes.

# The four entries below are libraries vendored inside pip 26.2.1 (pip/_vendor/vendor.txt)
# in the pip-audit tool environment at /opt/uv-tools/pip-audit. pip-audit needs pip to
# resolve requirements targets, 26.2.1 is the latest pip release, and the installed
# msgpack/urllib3 packages in both environments are already the fixed versions
# (docker/agent-runtime-constraints.txt). Remove these once pip ships updated vendored copies.

# msgpack 1.1.2: out-of-bounds read on Unpacker reuse (pip only unpacks its own HTTP cache)
